rows.en:
Do you even intend to listen to me seriously{f:?|, hm?}
{f:Listen, you, that|That}{f: wasn't funny at all.| wasn't much of a joke.}
{f:Lucky for you I'm a gentleman,|This is a real scoop, you know,}{f: because normally you'd get punched out for that.| so guess it properly.}
{f:You'd have no right|You}{f: to complain if you got slugged| really hurt my feelings}, {f:after a remark like that|saying that}.
{f:Look here|Look}, if I were a nutcase, I wouldn't be sitting in a place like this right now, would I?{p}

......And that's my story.
Now that I've surprised you all, let's have the next person talk.
........................Huh?
That's the end?
{f:Ending it like this|Ending it like this} is a bit much, isn't it{f:?|?}
Setting aside that ridiculous story about Kazama being an alien, had Kazama actually told us anything at all{f:?|, I wondered?}
{f:This|This just} isn't going to make an article{f:.|.}{p}I'll have to get him to do something about it{f:.|.}

"Huh?"
Kazama looked genuinely surprised.
But he quickly scoffed at me with contempt.{p}

"☆★·☆·★☆·★☆☆"
Huh?
What was that{f:?|?}
What did you just say, Kazama{f:?|?}
That wasn't Japanese{f:.|.}
But it didn't seem like a foreign language either... {f:He'd spoken some strange language!|He'd spoken some strange language!}{p}

Then he stood by the window and raised his hand toward the sky{f:.|.}
"Comrade found!
Sunbararians have already infiltrated Earth."{p}

At that moment, something like a signal suddenly flashed in the sky{f:.|.}
That was a flying saucer★
No, that's crazy...
While {f:I|I} stood there stunned, Kazama came up to me again and put his arm around my shoulders.
And he whispered in my ear again.
...This time, in Japanese.{p}

"Well, that's fine.
It's only natural that you can't believe me."
Kazama said it with a broad smile.{p}

"Our eyes have degenerated, you see.
Look..."
Kazama jabbed his fingers into his own eyes and gouged them out.{p}

"We can communicate with each other through ultrasound."
He {f:twitched|was twitching} his ears.
Apparently he could move his ears however he liked{f:.|.}
Th-that's amazing{f:!|!}
{f:With|With} that, no wonder he doesn't need eyes{f:.|.}
"And I can do things like this, too."{p}

"Kazama, what are you doing?"
Suddenly, still in that position, Kazama snapped his fingers.
Something went rumble, rumble, rumble.{p}
